{"product_id":"fluff-the-farting-fish","title":"Fluff the Farting Fish","description":"\u003cp\u003eElvie is desperate for a puppy that she can train up to do amazing tricks. But it's not a puppy Mum returns from the pet shop with, it's a fish.But Elvie doesn't give up. Determined to fulfill her dream of having a performing pet she trains up Fluff the fish. Fluff can't sit, she won't bark on command, but she does have a very special fishy talent all of her own . . .\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michael Rosen\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781849395274\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 80\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898786701465,"sku":"17RE-49781849395274","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69184bd9f361d_Fluff_the_Farting_Fish.jpg?v=1763223133","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/fluff-the-farting-fish","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}